{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185720/extras/YinYu.png?t=1743841084\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pixel Traveler is a rogue-lite action game where you can freely edit skill combo trigger chains. Design your own skill combinations and create different synergies each time; use limited resources to convert and synthesize to get the ideal skill combination, and debug to maximize the effect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple example of skill chain</strong>: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 General attack trigger skill = &gt; skill duration = &gt; trigger the next skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185720/extras/\u6280\u80fd\u94fe.gif?t=1743841084\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a variety of ways to accumulate and charge energy, which makes it convenient for players to edit various skill chains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The game also has a variety of equipment: mouse range search, automatic search, mobile attack, automatic attack and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can freely set: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">        Stereoscopic perspective (perspective perspective)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185720/extras/007.png?t=1743841084\" />        Flat perspective (parallel perspective) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185720/extras/008.png?t=1743841084\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3185720?t=1743841084","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3185720/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743841084","capsule_image":"https://sha